# Component Patterns for AI Wizard

## Component Structure

### Document Processing Components
Located in [src/app/components/document-processing/](mdc:src/app/components/document-processing/):
- `GrokProcessingInterface.tsx`: Main processing interface
- `ProgressComponents.tsx`: Progress tracking components
- `QueryHistory.tsx`: Query history management
- `RecentQueriesDashboard.tsx`: Dashboard for recent queries

### Chat Components
Located in [src/app/components/chat/](mdc:src/app/components/chat/):
- `ChatInput.tsx`: Input handling
- `ChatMessage.tsx`: Message display
- `ChatMessages.tsx`: Message list
- `ChatSidebar.tsx`: Sidebar navigation

## Component Patterns

### State Management
- Use React hooks for local state
- Implement proper loading states
- Handle error states gracefully
- Provide user feedback

### Props Interface
```typescript
interface ComponentProps {
  data: ProcessingData
  onUpdate: (data: ProcessingData) => void
  loading?: boolean
  error?: string
}
```

### Error Handling
- Display user-friendly error messages
- Implement retry mechanisms
- Provide fallback UI
- Log errors for debugging

## UI/UX Patterns

### Loading States
- Show progress indicators
- Provide estimated completion times
- Display current operation status
- Allow cancellation where appropriate

### User Feedback
- Success/error notifications
- Progress updates
- Interactive elements
- Clear action buttons

## Integration Patterns

### API Integration
- Use custom hooks for API calls
- Implement proper error handling
- Provide loading states
- Cache results when appropriate

### Real-time Updates
- WebSocket connections for live updates
- Polling for status changes
- Event-driven updates
- Optimistic UI updates

## Accessibility

### ARIA Labels
- Proper labeling for screen readers
- Keyboard navigation support
- Focus management
- Color contrast compliance

### User Experience
- Clear visual hierarchy
- Intuitive navigation
- Responsive design
- Mobile-friendly interfaces